  <item>
    <title>EP03 小宇宙Plus上线，听播客真的需要AI么</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/678a36cdacc25c38ad5dc61a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">678a36cdacc25c38ad5dc61a</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 17 Jan 2025 12:41:45 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>AI 听播客给我们的是否只是获得知识的错觉？生活场景下真的有这么多需要 AI 辅助内容摄取的场景吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>*本期节目不讨论小宇宙 plus 的具体功能，仅仅是由此而发的个人思考。个人观点且听一乐，欢迎大伙儿评论交流～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 为生活or为工作，使用AI工具的两大场景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="391">06:31</a> 膨胀的收藏夹，真的会去看么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="733">12:13</a> 不服务于生产，AI工具提供的信息是否又是一种囤积</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="928">15:28</a> 播客往往是和生活场景相关联的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1361">22:41</a> AI浓缩后的知识好吸收吗，长文和播客的路还得自己走</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1539">25:39</a> 两点直达or城市漫游，两种选择两种体验</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播@Tengko</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/673d696811045e78e5762c58/lsX1Ll-nrrtvpl1FmiTNtQDEA8jl.m4a" length="40356337" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:27:48</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnLni4N2xXW4tmQjvvvbwUfT4YBb.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP02 擅长、喜欢和社会需要，啥事儿是即便不赚钱我也愿意干的</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6780d9391bf3f0ab2b3d0fe2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6780d9391bf3f0ab2b3d0fe2</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 10 Jan 2025 08:27:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>擅长、喜欢和社会需要，到底要怎样选择研究或职业方向？当面对缺失的培养体系，如何在科研和职业探索中自处？找不到完美的工作，又如何定位和发现自己的独特价值？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期是我和小黑临时起意的闲聊，日常观点碰撞，不求能给出什么建议或启发，大家且听一乐。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="133">02:13</a> 开场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="219">03:39</a> 如果即使不赚钱，我想做什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="862">14:22</a> 课题组得有个完善的培养体系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1130">18:50</a> 选择匹配自己的团队很重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1326">22:06</a> 探索学习的过程到底有没有意义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a> 关于两个学校辩论的筛选和培养（小黑激情输出）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2022">33:42</a> 一体两面的培养体系和筛选体系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2483">41:23</a> 缺失的职业培养好像已经成了某种常态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3044">50:44</a> 喜欢，擅长，社会需要，职业选择的三个维度</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播: @Tengko @小黑</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM: Prelude &amp; Fugue No.1 in C major, BWV846</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/673d696811045e78e5762c58/louKYRogkq5c7NwaWJuMPlvyXUkh.m4a" length="93850405" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:04:40</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiiiRK-eqzMVAvr2bLAw7eMigbRe.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP01 读《超越百岁》，长寿也是在做任务管理</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6778d56a15a5fd520eeefb68</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6778d56a15a5fd520eeefb68</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 04 Jan 2025 06:31:38 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>*本期跟原书内容关联度不高，主要是个人阅读中由此延伸的各种思考。原书中有很多很多可以参考借鉴的观点，但个人感觉作者的行文有些啰嗦。推荐大家听 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65f2cd846764957079505447" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65f2cd846764957079505447"><span>纵横四海的这期节目</span></a><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span>25/03/12更新</span></p><span></span><p><span>这两天围绕这期内容，又做了很多延伸思考，整理成了一篇长文，相比播客结构会更系统些 </span><a href="https://sspai.com/post/97221" data-url="https://sspai.com/post/97221"><span>链接</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="61">01:01</a> 读书、听播客真是个“浪费时间”的爱好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="129">02:09</a> 《超越百岁》&amp;《控糖革命》两本书的关联思考：关照当下和着眼未来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="565">09:25</a> 流行病学调查 &amp; 临床研究：现有的研究范式好像不能回答医学3.0所关心的问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1078">17:58</a> 任务四象限 &amp; 预防医学：重要但不紧急的事情真的该做</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>雨白和张云帆的对谈，聊任务管理和人生规划，很有启发 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/671b521ceb46cd6655a82f9b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/671b521ceb46cd6655a82f9b"><span>知行小酒馆E162 对话张云帆</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>任务的四象限法则</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ftafcp8RbzWncKSv2SKc2OQLdPGz.webp"></figure><span></span><p><span>最后再分享一句，书中对自己蛮有启发的话，与大家共勉！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp33E32yK37SlQ1NdJdHGiTqZ361.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhfrUxyc7ko_4Xtj9noebFevH8BX.m4a" length="22560824" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:22:54</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiiiRK-eqzMVAvr2bLAw7eMigbRe.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
